	(text "Flight controller and power distribution board of the FERA modular vehicle hub.\nSTM32H743 + ICM-42688-P + DPS368, 4S battery input with current sense, four identical module ports.\nEach box below is one page. Nets are joined by name: every pin carries a label or a power symbol." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30 34 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "76da7e94-bb42-5019-9605-462800b116cf"))
	(text "Generated from hardware/fera-core/gen/design.py, the same file the\nboard is built from, and checked against it (gen/make_schematic.py --check).\nFootprints on the board carry the UUIDs of these symbols, so\n'Update PCB from Schematic' matches them directly." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30 158 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f6be4be9-2e1e-50ed-840d-7cd34b69035f"))
